@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/tower#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix planning: <http://example.org/orexis/planning#> .
@prefix execution: <http://example.org/orexis/execution#> .
@prefix belief: <http://example.org/orexis/belief#> .

<> a orexis:SelfGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  WHO THIS AGENT IS: the mover, and this document is its own by the self it states. Booted as
#  "mover", the agent checks that this is so.
#
#  WHAT IT RUNS: it plans the tower and walks the plan, and it is a deliberator, since the tower's
#  domain ships the rules that conclude Hanoi's facts from the grid's, which refine a move into the
#  courier's steps beneath it.

:mover a orexis:Self , planning:Planner , execution:Executor , belief:Deliberator .
